1X39yNzFU\n=5ohd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 04b6c24847e25b7acc553e50808d3e1a25b7232b\nparent cd221d7408ea164b739d70408acc989eb83d6750\nauthor Pavel Guzenfeld <67074795+PavelGuzenfeld@users.noreply.github.com> 1790929199 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790929199 +0200\n\nTolerate a finalized sigint guard condition in Executor.__del__ (#1734)\n\nWhen the executor sits in a reference cycle, the collector can run the\nSignalHandlerGuardCondition's __del__ before the executor's, and the\nexecutor's __del__ then raised an unraisable InvalidHandle from destroy().\nCatch it the same way SignalHandlerGuardCondition.__del__ already does.\n\nCloses #1733\n\nGenerated-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic)\n\nSigned-off-by: Pavel Guzenfeld <pavelguzenfeld@gmail.com>", "verified_at": "2026-10-02T08:19:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclpy/commits/c412c21df54a4c2029e68bd46816f2db6ef41aa4", "html_url": "https://github.com/ros2/rclpy/commit/c412c21df54a4c2029e68bd46816f2db6ef41aa4", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclpy/commits/c412c21df54a4c2029e68bd46816f2db6ef41aa4/comments", "author": {"login": "PavelGuzenfeld", "id": 67074795, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDc0Nzk1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67074795?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/PavelGuzenfeld", "html_url": "https://github.com/PavelGuzenfeld", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/PavelGuzenfeld/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/PavelGuzenfeld/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/PavelGuzenfeld/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/PavelGuzenfeld/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/PavelGuzenfeld/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/PavelGuzenfeld/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/PavelGuzenfeld/repos", "events_url": "https://api.gi